{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"10":"The Chapters on Divorce"},"section_detail":{"10":{"hadithnumber_first":2016,"hadithnumber_last":2477,"arabicnumber_first":2016,"arabicnumber_last":2477,"name_native":"كتاب الطلاق"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2052,"arabicnumber":2052,"text":"حدثنا ابو بكر بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا ابو معاوية، عن الاعمش، عن مسلم، عن مسروق، عن عايشة، قالت خيرنا رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم فاخترناه . فلم نره شييا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":10,"hadith":37}}]}